  "paper_scope": "The paper presents a general theory for the low-temperature dependence of superfluid stiffness in superfluids without Galilean symmetry, based on Popov's hydrodynamic action with anharmonic terms. It derives a universal formula for the depletion of superfluid density and validates it with numerical simulations of soft-core bosons on a 2D square lattice. The paper also discusses experimental data for helium in disordered media and universal thermodynamics.",
